PIPELINE AS A CODE:
Running more than one command/action inside a single stage.
to reduce the length of the code.
to save time.

pipeline {
    agent any
    
    stages {
        stage('one') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/devopsbyraham/jenkins-java-project.git'
                sh 'mvn compile'
                sh 'mvn test'
                sh 'mvn clean package'
            }
        }
    }
}

PIPELINE AS A CODE OVER MULTI-STAGE:
executing multiple commands or multiple actions on multiple stages.


pipeline {
    agent any
    
    stages {
        stage('one') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/devopsbyraham/jenkins-java-project.git'
                sh 'mvn compile'
            }
        }
        stage('two') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn test'
                sh 'mvn clean package'
            }
        }
    }
}

PIPELINE AS A CODE OVER SINGLE-SHELL:
executing multiple commands over a single shell.


pipeline {
    agent any
    
    stages {
        stage('one') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/devopsbyraham/jenkins-java-project.git'
                sh '''
                mvn compile
                mvn test
                mvn package
                mvn install
                mvn clean package
                '''
            }
        }
    }
}



