POST BUILD ACTIONS:
actions the we perform after the build are called as post build action.

always: if the build failed or success it will run the post actions.
success: It will execute post actions only when the build is successful.
failure: It will execute post actions only when the build is failed.

pipeline {
    agent any 
    
    environment {
        name = "raham"
        loc = "hyderabad"
    }
    stages {
        stage('one') {
            steps {
                s 'env'
            }
        }
    }
    post {
        always {
            echo "The build is done."
        }
    }
}

